import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---
<DocsLayout locale="en" title="Agent automation" description="Use the CLI as a stable tool boundary with structured output, idempotent requests, explicit exit codes, and secret injection." section="Agent integration">
  <Fragment slot="toc"><a href="#output">Structured output</a><a href="#idempotency">Idempotency</a><a href="#exit-codes">Exit codes</a><a href="#ci">CI example</a></Fragment>
  <h2 id="output">Structured output</h2><p>Interactive terminals use human-readable output. Agents and scripts should explicitly request JSON or JSONL.</p><pre><code>emoera search "release rollback" --json
emoera ask "Return evidence line by line" --jsonl --no-color</code></pre>
  <h2 id="idempotency">Idempotency and tracing</h2><p>Retries can happen in the network, runner, or agent. Pass a stable request ID for long-running or stateful operations:</p><pre><code>emoera --request-id "audit-20260727-001" \
  ask "Review deployment risk" --json</code></pre>
  <h2 id="exit-codes">Exit codes</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>Success</td><td>Read output</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Configuration error</td><td>Fix the call; do not retry</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Authentication failed</td><td>Rotate token</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Forbidden</td><td>Check scopes</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Quota or rate limit</td><td>Back off</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Network or service error</td><td>Retry with exponential backoff</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <h2 id="ci">CI example</h2><pre><code>export EMOERA_API_TOKEN="$EMOERA_API_TOKEN"
result="$(emoera ask "Summarize change risk" --json --no-color)"
printf '%s\n' "$result" &gt; rag-audit.json</code></pre><p>Load tokens from the CI secret manager and never echo them into logs.</p>
</DocsLayout>
